##

00:00:00.157 --> 00:00:02.157
I'm with Dr. Rohin Francis,
cardiologist,

00:00:02.157 --> 00:00:05.734 position:64%
and we are about to disrespect the entire
medical and surgical professions,

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.801 line:91%
by playing <i>Operation</i> in the
Old Operating Theatre in London.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:11.215 line:91%
But before we do that,
we do have a disclaimer.

00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:13.183 line:92%
<c.yellow>We're using TENS machines today</c>

00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:15.878
<c.yellow>to deliver a little electric shock
to one another,</c>

00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:17.816
<c.yellow>to make the game
a little more interesting.</c>

00:00:17.816 --> 00:00:21.689 position:69%
<c.yellow>But these are medical devices.
We've taken all necessary precautions today,</c>

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:25.923 position:59%
<c.yellow>and have medical assistance available,
so please don't try this at home.</c>

00:00:25.923 --> 00:00:28.122 position:58% line:92%
Also, we have a cardiologist on site.

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:30.230
<c.yellow>That's right.
If I have a cardiac arrest,</c>

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.937 line:92%
<c.yellow>I will resuscitate myself.</c>

00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:36.896
One rule we should mention
to the audience...

00:00:36.896 --> 00:00:39.818 line:91%
<i>we did try this,
just playing regular Operation,</i>

00:00:39.818 --> 00:00:41.320 line:91%
<i>as you're allowed to
in the rules.</i>

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.845 line:91%
<i>And we both cleared the board
without ever getting shocked.</i>

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.773 line:91%
This is too easy, Rohin.
This is too easy.

00:00:46.773 --> 00:00:48.755 line:85%
<c.yellow>Well, I mean, yeah.</c>

00:00:48.755 --> 00:00:51.822 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>You've just discovered
the secret of surgery. It is pretty easy.</c>

00:00:51.822 --> 00:00:53.677 line:92%
So, new rule:

00:00:53.677 --> 00:00:56.948
We can only float our hand
above the board.

00:00:56.948 --> 00:00:59.125 line:92%
We cannot rest on the table.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.347 line:85%
This is gonna suck...!

00:01:01.911 --> 00:01:04.479 line:91%
<c.yellow>Tom, we need to maintain
strict asepsis here, so...</c>

00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:06.390 line:91%
Yep, yep.
<c.yellow>So, we've washed our hands,</c>

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:09.006
<c.yellow>but I need to don my
surgical cap.</c>

00:01:09.506 --> 00:01:12.001 line:91%
<c.yellow>Come for the occasion.
This is the one I use at work.</c>

00:01:12.001 --> 00:01:15.994 position:69%
We've only tested these on the lowest power,
and we are now...

00:01:15.994 --> 00:01:18.279 line:92%
gone quite high, so...

00:01:18.279 --> 00:01:20.607 line:91%
Rock-paper-scissors to start?
<c.yellow>Let's do it.</c>

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:24.060 line:92%
<c.yellow>Agh...</c>

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.195 line:92%
You know what, you can go first.

00:01:26.195 --> 00:01:27.942 line:85%
Good luck. Pick a card.

00:01:27.942 --> 00:01:29.846
<c.yellow>It's quite chilly in here.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It is.</c>

00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:31.238 position:58% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (horn crescendo into pulsing synth)</i></c>

00:01:29.846 --> 00:01:31.778 line:92%
<c.yellow>I'm getting my excuses out early.</c>

00:01:31.778 --> 00:01:34.733 line:85%
<c.yellow>Charlie Horse for 400 points.</c>

00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:36.511 line:91%
That is...
<c.yellow>And...</c>

00:01:36.511 --> 00:01:37.735 line:85%
Ah, just there.

00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:39.604 line:85%
<c.yellow>Is that, like, some American...?</c>

00:01:39.604 --> 00:01:41.783 line:91%
That is an American term
for a cramp, I think.

00:01:41.783 --> 00:01:43.962
<c.yellow>I see, alright.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Some sort of cramp. I don't know.</c>

00:01:43.962 --> 00:01:45.974
Alright. Good luck.
<c.yellow>This is excellent.</c>

00:01:45.974 --> 00:01:48.678
The minute I see
the tiniest bit of light on there!

00:01:48.678 --> 00:01:50.812 position:56%
Oh yeah, we're controlling
each other's TENS units, by the way.

00:01:50.812 --> 00:01:52.554 line:85%
<c.yellow>It slid.</c>

00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:54.469 line:91%
It slid underneath there,
hasn't it?

00:01:54.469 --> 00:01:55.364 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay...</c>

00:01:59.514 --> 00:02:00.947 line:85%
<i>(breathily)</i> Hoooh...

00:02:00.947 --> 00:02:02.151 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, I can't.</c>

00:02:02.476 --> 00:02:03.932 line:85%
You're gonna have to rotate.

00:02:03.376 --> 00:02:04.090 line:7%
<c.colorFF8888><i>[BUZZ]</i></c>

00:02:03.932 --> 00:02:06.001 line:92%
<c.yellow>Oh! Ack, Jesus!</c>

00:02:09.244 --> 00:02:11.457
<c.yellow>Ah...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's a good start.</c>

00:02:11.457 --> 00:02:13.853 line:91%
You say that, and now I've gotta
try and do the exact same thing.

00:02:13.853 --> 00:02:15.317 line:85%
So, um, good luck.

00:02:15.317 --> 00:02:16.727 line:91%
<c.yellow>I've loosened it for you.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>You have.</c>

00:02:16.727 --> 00:02:18.352 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's easier.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:02:18.352 --> 00:02:19.517 line:92%
<c.yellow>Right. I'm poised.</c>

00:02:19.517 --> 00:02:21.576
Oh, you see,
there's a leg just there.

00:02:20.782 --> 00:02:22.741 position:58% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (horn crescendo into pulsing synth)</i></c>

00:02:21.576 --> 00:02:24.473 line:85%
That's— That's fine, that's fine.

00:02:27.076 --> 00:02:29.338 line:68%
It's so difficult
without leaning on anything.

00:02:30.102 --> 00:02:31.193 line:64%
<i>(sighs)</i>

00:02:30.289 --> 00:02:32.128 line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (high percussion loop added)</i></c>

00:02:34.065 --> 00:02:35.328 line:64%
Can I rotate it?

00:02:36.403 --> 00:02:37.162 line:7%
<c.colorFF8888><i>[BUZZ]</i></c>

00:02:37.155 --> 00:02:39.301 line:91%
Gaaah! <i>(huffs)</i>
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:02:39.962 --> 00:02:41.772
Mmph!
<c.yellow>This is good.</c>

00:02:41.772 --> 00:02:44.839
'Kay. 'Kay. 'Kay.
<c.yellow><i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:02:44.839 --> 00:02:46.461
<i>(inhales sharply)</i>
<c.yellow>Right, so...</c>

00:02:46.461 --> 00:02:47.582 line:92%
I'm just gonna put that there,

00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:49.287
'cause apparently this is
gonna take a few attempts!

00:02:49.287 --> 00:02:50.649 line:85%
Your— Your shot.

00:02:50.649 --> 00:02:54.369 position:59%
<c.yellow>Do you wanna come back to it, as like,
the beast we couldn't defeat?</c>

00:02:54.369 --> 00:02:56.297 line:92%
Okay, my pick then.

00:02:56.297 --> 00:02:58.244 line:85%
Bread Basket for 1000.

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:00.551 position:58% line:85%
Okay, that's a nice, big space there.

00:03:00.551 --> 00:03:03.103 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's also a nice, big... orifice.</c>

00:03:03.103 --> 00:03:04.350 line:64%
There's not much to...

00:03:05.441 --> 00:03:06.390 line:64%
<c.yellow>Well...</c>

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:09.001 line:68%
I realise that's a technical term,
but still!

00:03:07.741 --> 00:03:09.497 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (cello/synth drone)</i></c>

00:03:09.351 --> 00:03:11.922 line:91%
Hooh...
<c.yellow>Okay, I'm poised.</c>

00:03:12.585 --> 00:03:15.155
What do I...
How do I even grab on to that?

00:03:15.688 --> 00:03:18.234
<c.yellow>A good surgeon wouldn't ask
these questions, Tom.</c>

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:20.140 line:92%
I'm not a good surgeon!

00:03:23.361 --> 00:03:24.320 size:47% position:23% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>(music fades)</i></c>

00:03:23.448 --> 00:03:24.356 line:85%
There we go, okay.

00:03:24.356 --> 00:03:26.677
<c.yellow>Ohh, well done, well done.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Hoooh!</c>

00:03:26.677 --> 00:03:28.089
That's fine. There was something,
but as soon as you moved it,

00:03:28.089 --> 00:03:29.816 position:56%
it was something to grab onto there.
That's fine.

00:03:29.816 --> 00:03:31.483 line:92%
Alright, your pick.

00:03:31.483 --> 00:03:34.179 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay. Ah, cheap one.
Only 300.</c>

00:03:34.179 --> 00:03:35.845 line:85%
<c.yellow>Writer's Cramp. Now...</c>

00:03:34.755 --> 00:03:36.284 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (cello/synth drone)</i></c>

00:03:35.845 --> 00:03:38.026 line:85%
Ohh! Ohh!

00:03:38.026 --> 00:03:42.131 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>This is the one I'd...
spotted earlier as being problematic.</c>

00:03:38.622 --> 00:03:40.319 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (echoed percussion)</i></c>

00:03:42.131 --> 00:03:43.704 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i> Let's be honest.

00:03:43.704 --> 00:03:45.704 line:91%
Everything we're doing here today
is problematic.

00:03:46.673 --> 00:03:48.060 line:91%
Alright.
<c.yellow>Uh...</c>

00:03:50.447 --> 00:03:51.490 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh man.</c>

00:03:54.909 --> 00:03:56.281 size:88% position:44% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (hollow synth crescendo)</i></c>

00:03:57.573 --> 00:03:59.750 line:85%
<i>(huffs slowly)</i>

00:03:58.813 --> 00:03:59.899 size:47% position:23% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>(music fades)</i></c>

00:04:00.152 --> 00:04:01.346 line:85%
<c.yellow>There you go.</c>

00:04:02.049 --> 00:04:02.839 line:91%
Hooh.
<c.yellow>Nice.</c>

00:04:02.839 --> 00:04:05.817
<c.yellow>I've warmed up now,
channelling the surgical gods.</c>

00:04:05.817 --> 00:04:08.429
You wanna flip that over,
take the points.

00:04:08.429 --> 00:04:09.517 line:92%
<c.yellow>Take the points.</c>

00:04:09.517 --> 00:04:12.893 position:56% line:91%
For 200— Oh, it's the Pulled Muscle.
It's the elastic band.

00:04:13.393 --> 00:04:14.456 line:85%
<c.yellow>I think that's easy.</c>

00:04:14.456 --> 00:04:16.666 line:91%
<c.yellow>I think that's an easy one.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Eh, I'm not so sure.</c>

00:04:16.666 --> 00:04:17.715 line:85%
<i>(whispers)</i> Okay.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:18.470 size:59% position:30% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (ambient synth)</i></c>

00:04:19.582 --> 00:04:21.959 size:88% position:44% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (heavy synth beat added)</i></c>

00:04:24.399 --> 00:04:25.302 line:85%
Okay.

00:04:25.148 --> 00:04:26.503 size:47% position:23% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>(music fades)</i></c>

00:04:25.802 --> 00:04:28.410
Ohh, we might need to
ramp the difficulty up on this.

00:04:45.839 --> 00:04:47.602 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (low string pulses)</i></c>

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.988 line:85%
Left-handed?

00:04:31.493 --> 00:04:33.786 line:85%
<c.yellow>'Kay, with no resting.</c>

00:04:33.786 --> 00:04:34.734 line:85%
Left-handed.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.769
<c.yellow>...Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Your card.</c>

00:04:38.372 --> 00:04:40.241 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah... <i>(stammers)</i></c>

00:04:40.241 --> 00:04:42.510 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay, Butterflies in the Stomach.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's fine. That's an easy one.</c>

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.001 line:91%
You can do that left-handed.
No worries.

00:04:44.001 --> 00:04:46.016 line:85%
<c.yellow>That's what I'm feeling right now.</c>

00:04:50.535 --> 00:04:51.118 line:7%
<c.colorFF8888><i>[BUZZ]</i></c>

00:04:51.116 --> 00:04:53.332 line:92%
<c.yellow>Ack! Oh, it's the wrong hand.</c>

00:04:53.332 --> 00:04:54.768 line:92%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:04:56.493 --> 00:04:57.519 line:64%
Pick up the—

00:04:56.494 --> 00:04:57.535
<c.colorFF8888><i>[BUZZ]</i></c>

00:04:57.519 --> 00:04:59.580 line:91%
That... does not count.
That does not count!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.352 line:91%
<c.yellow>I didn't do it.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:05:01.852 --> 00:05:02.995 line:85%
Right, here we go.

00:05:02.355 --> 00:05:03.716 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (low string pulses)</i></c>

00:05:03.829 --> 00:05:05.341 line:85%
Okay. <i>(scoffs)</i>

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.348 line:85%
How do I...? Nngh.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.984 line:85%
<i>(sighs)</i>

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:12.787 size:47% position:23% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>(music fades)</i></c>

00:05:14.459 --> 00:05:16.578 line:85%
<c.yellow>Well, I'm getting humiliated here.</c>

00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:18.967 line:85%
Wishbone, 600.

00:05:18.967 --> 00:05:21.501 line:91%
That does not look nice.
<c.yellow>No, I think.</c>

00:05:21.501 --> 00:05:22.282 line:92%
Alright.

00:05:22.156 --> 00:05:23.276 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (cello/synth drone)</i></c>

00:05:22.282 --> 00:05:24.817
<c.yellow>This is, of course, entirely
anatomically correct.</c>

00:05:24.817 --> 00:05:25.698
Yeah. Yeah.
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>

00:05:25.698 --> 00:05:29.181 line:91%
<c.yellow>Humans famously do have
a wishbone in the sternum.</c>

00:05:29.205 --> 00:05:30.950 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (synth intensifies)</i></c>

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:31.602 line:7%
<c.colorFF8888><i>[BUZZ]</i></c>

00:05:32.178 --> 00:05:33.034 size:47% position:23% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>(music halts)</i></c>

00:05:32.763 --> 00:05:34.447 line:85%
Uh, you didn't— That didn't hit.

00:05:34.447 --> 00:05:36.306
<c.yellow>Nothing, nothing?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Do you wanna try that again?</c>

00:05:38.238 --> 00:05:40.737 position:63% line:91%
'Kay, you're gonna have to turn that up.
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>

00:05:43.759 --> 00:05:44.576 line:92%
<c.yellow>Alright.</c>

00:05:45.315 --> 00:05:47.338
Gaaaah!
<c.yellow><i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:50.059 line:92%
<i>(groans, inhales sharply)</i>

00:05:50.059 --> 00:05:52.067 line:91%
I'm-a turn this one up
as well, 'cause...

00:05:52.067 --> 00:05:53.484 line:85%
that only seems fair.

00:05:53.484 --> 00:05:55.397 line:85%
<c.yellow>Mine was working fine.</c>

00:05:55.397 --> 00:05:57.799 line:85%
Yeah! <i>(breathes heavily)</i>

00:05:57.242 --> 00:05:58.152 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (cello/synth drone)</i></c>

00:05:57.799 --> 00:06:00.389
<c.yellow>Yeah, this left-handed thing is
a bit of a curveball here.</c>

00:06:00.389 --> 00:06:01.965 line:92%
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:01.965 --> 00:06:03.807 line:91%
Do you ever get asked
to do surgery left-handed?

00:06:03.807 --> 00:06:05.933 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's not a common request.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>No.</c>

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:07.781 line:85%
<c.yellow>Uh...</c>

00:06:08.281 --> 00:06:09.700 line:92%
It's the rotation.

00:06:09.315 --> 00:06:10.896 line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (echoing percussion added)</i></c>

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:12.450 position:69%
<c.yellow>I don't know if the camera is catching this,
but it is completely in the wrong position.</c>

00:06:11.553 --> 00:06:13.006 size:63% position:31% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (synth arpeggio)</i></c>

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:17.474 line:91%
<c.yellow>Wow, I didn't realise how bad
my left hand is.</c>

00:06:19.245 --> 00:06:20.606 position:59% line:85%
I'm trying to see the light under you.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.982 size:72% position:36% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (music intensifies)</i></c>

00:06:24.101 --> 00:06:25.556 line:85%
Oh, if you get this...

00:06:30.305 --> 00:06:32.871 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(whispers) </i>Oh, it got stuck.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Ohh!</c>

00:06:31.046 --> 00:06:33.045 line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (hollow synth drone, music fades)</i></c>

00:06:33.483 --> 00:06:34.727 line:85%
<c.yellow>Success.</c>

00:06:34.727 --> 00:06:37.358 line:91%
I heard a noise there,
and I nearly gave you the shock,

00:06:37.358 --> 00:06:40.410 position:59% line:91%
but it wasn't the light,
that was just you scraping past the...

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.743
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright, well done.</c>

00:06:41.743 --> 00:06:43.995
I think we're...
<c.yellow>Difficult extrication.</c>

00:06:43.995 --> 00:06:46.644
Alright, that's one back to you,
and it's your card.

00:06:46.644 --> 00:06:47.848 line:92%
<c.yellow>Right, okay.</c>

00:06:47.848 --> 00:06:50.231 line:85%
<c.yellow>Broken Heart. Very appropriate.</c>

00:06:50.231 --> 00:06:51.335 line:85%
Uh-ooh.

00:06:51.335 --> 00:06:53.673 line:91%
So I think that'll be easy,
once you get it in position.

00:06:53.673 --> 00:06:55.850
<c.yellow>Familiar territory.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah. Yeah.</c>

00:06:56.225 --> 00:06:57.765
<c.yellow>...Oh!</c>
<i>(belly laughs)</i>

00:06:57.765 --> 00:06:59.663 position:72%
That was what I was saying.
I don't know how well it's shown up on camera.

00:06:59.663 --> 00:07:02.711 line:91%
That is tucked
away from you, over there.

00:07:02.148 --> 00:07:04.168 position:58% line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (horn crescendo into pulsing synth)</i></c>

00:07:02.711 --> 00:07:04.414
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Good luck.</c>

00:07:04.914 --> 00:07:06.827
<c.yellow>I'm gonna have to try this
when I go back to work.</c>

00:07:06.827 --> 00:07:08.918
<c.yellow>Just say, "I'm just gonna be
left-handed today."</c>

00:07:09.219 --> 00:07:11.381 position:58% line:92%
<c.yellow>Just hope patients are understanding.</c>

00:07:11.592 --> 00:07:13.197 line:0%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (high percussion loop added)</i></c>

00:07:16.148 --> 00:07:18.251 line:91%
<c.yellow>Nothing to grip onto.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:07:19.867 --> 00:07:21.356 line:85%
Keep an eye on that light.

00:07:21.356 --> 00:07:23.533
<c.yellow>I seem to have pushed it further.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yes, you have.</c>

00:07:23.533 --> 00:07:25.076 line:92%
Yeah, you absolutely have.

00:07:27.978 --> 00:07:30.195 position:59% line:91%
I'm slightly worried in this position,
